  "skos:note": [
    {
      "@value": "Deprecated 2026-09-27. This concept is not specific to X-ray absorption spectroscopy, so it is superseded by the NeXus term named in dcterms:isReplacedBy. The concept is retained, not removed: records published before the change still cite it. CDIF profiles accept both spellings during the transition.",
